{"id":"fbbe1e58786a3b0b","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-amoeba-condition.md","title":"ZFC Amoeba Condition","display":"df-zfc-amoeba-condition — ZFC Amoeba Condition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-amoeba-condition","aliases":["58-df-zfc-amoeba-condition"],"display":"df-zfc-amoeba-condition — ZFC Amoeba Condition","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob4-probability-measure.md]]","[[58-df-cantor-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-amoeba-condition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-amoeba-condition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-amoeba-condition — ZFC Amoeba Condition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b7f8df0ffe546f56\" href=\"?note=b7f8df0ffe546f56\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob4-probability-measure.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob4-probability-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4e3b467d5761af40\" href=\"?note=4e3b467d5761af40\" title=\"58-df-cantor-space.md\">58-df-cantor-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,\\varepsilon,\\mu\\in V\">\\(B,\\varepsilon,\\mu\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\mathcal C=2^\\omega\">\\(B\\subseteq\\mathcal C=2^\\omega\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0&lt;\\varepsilon\\leq1\">\\(0&lt;\\varepsilon\\leq1\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(\\mathcal C,\\tau_{\\mathcal C})\">\\(\\mathcal B(\\mathcal C,\\tau_{\\mathcal C})\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\sigma]\">\\([\\sigma]\\)</span> (Cantor-space Borel structure and cylinders, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4e3b467d5761af40\" href=\"?note=4e3b467d5761af40\" title=\"58-df-cantor-space.md\">58-df-cantor-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb4ProbabilityMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb4ProbabilityMeasure}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b7f8df0ffe546f56\" href=\"?note=b7f8df0ffe546f56\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob4-probability-measure.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob4-probability-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AmoebaConditionStructure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{AmoebaConditionStructure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AmoebaCondition}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{AmoebaCondition}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (explicit predicate and compatibility projection defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}amoeba\\text{-}condition\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{AmoebaConditionStructure}_S(B,\\varepsilon,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal C=2^\\omega\\land B\\in\\mathcal B(\\mathcal C,\\tau_{\\mathcal C})\\land0&lt;\\varepsilon\\leq1\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb4ProbabilityMeasure}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal B(\\mathcal C,\\tau_{\\mathcal C}),\\mu)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\bigl(\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}\\bigr)\\land\\mu(B)&lt;\\varepsilon\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}amoeba\\text{-}condition\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{AmoebaConditionStructure}_S(B,\\varepsilon,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal C=2^\\omega\\land B\\in\\mathcal B(\\mathcal C,\\tau_{\\mathcal C})\\land0&lt;\\varepsilon\\leq1\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb4ProbabilityMeasure}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal B(\\mathcal C,\\tau_{\\mathcal C}),\\mu)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\bigl(\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}\\bigr)\\land\\mu(B)&lt;\\varepsilon\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}amoeba\\text{-}condition\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{AmoebaCondition}_S(B,\\varepsilon)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mu\\in V\\;\\mathrm{AmoebaConditionStructure}_S(B,\\varepsilon,\\mu)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}amoeba\\text{-}condition\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{AmoebaCondition}_S(B,\\varepsilon)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mu\\in V\\;\\mathrm{AmoebaConditionStructure}_S(B,\\varepsilon,\\mu)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The product measure is now an explicit argument and is pinned down on every basic cylinder; the former binary predicate depended on a free <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> and an undefined probability-measure symbol.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target"